<script setup lang="ts">
import { ref } from 'vue'
const capacity = ref(2)
const jobs = ref(4)
</script>
<template><article><VContainer tag="section" class="detail-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Glossary and playground</p><h1>Concurrency primitives</h1><p>Choose a primitive from the invariant it protects, not from its name.</p></VContainer><VContainer tag="section" class="lesson-content"><VRow class="glossary-grid"><VCol cols="12" sm="6"><VCard tag="article" height="100%"><VCardTitle tag="h2">Latest wins</VCardTitle><VCardText>Only the newest intent may commit.</VCardText></VCard></VCol><VCol cols="12" sm="6"><VCard tag="article" height="100%"><VCardTitle tag="h2">Mutex</VCardTitle><VCardText>One owner; deduplication is separate.</VCardText></VCard></VCol><VCol cols="12" sm="6"><VCard tag="article" height="100%"><VCardTitle tag="h2">Semaphore</VCardTitle><VCardText>At most N active jobs and a FIFO queue.</VCardText></VCard></VCol><VCol cols="12" sm="6"><VCard tag="article" height="100%"><VCardTitle tag="h2">Single-flight</VCardTitle><VCardText>One in-flight producer per key; not a cache.</VCardText></VCard></VCol></VRow><VSheet tag="section" class="comparison-controls pa-6" rounded="xl"><h2>Permit playground</h2><label>Capacity <input v-model.number="capacity" type="range" min="1" max="4" /></label><label>Jobs <input v-model.number="jobs" type="range" min="1" max="8" /></label><p>Active: {{ Math.min(capacity, jobs) }} · Queued: {{ Math.max(0, jobs - capacity) }} · Available: {{ Math.max(0, capacity - jobs) }}</p></VSheet></VContainer></article></template>
